<title>JAPAN: Bank of Okinawa - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Bank of Okinawa - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    25.78		vs	   31.24</p>
<p> Operating	    5.45		vs	    7.14</p>
<p> Current		2.48		vs	    2.19</p>
<p> Net		    1.39		vs	    1.11</p>
